@tempo:100

cv sweep : `js: (t, dur) => { return 0.5 + 0.5 * Math.sin(2 * Math.PI * t / dur); }`

S -> Lead Lead Lead Lead

Lead -> C4(cutoff:sweep) E4 G4(cutoff:sweep) _ (wave:sawtooth, vel:90)
